  stages:
  - title: The family photo
    lines:
    - "\u25CF An old photo of a big Jewish family."
    - "\u25CF They sit together at the table at home."
    - "\u25CF Behind them, one small square of the wall is unfinished."
    - "\u25CF It looks like they left it so on purpose. Why?"
